  "description": "Shared record envelope. The template payload is a derived projection built by the adapter from top-level source fields and the versioned template catalog; it is not duplicated in the source registry to avoid drift. Conditional requirements now include researchSources, researchSynthesis, and researchLimitations for source Complex, Hyper-Complex, MIRROR, CIRCLES, BLUEPRINT, and CASCADE records. Adds explicit source-child-label records with provenance and research/crosswalk fields. Requires independent research synthesis and limitations for DESCENT and Super-Complex candidate records. Requires researched behavioral-energy fields for all archetype candidates. Requires independent historical-context research and explicit cultural limitations for cultural-figure mapping rows. Adds researched provisional interpretations and adversarial limitations for source roster and historical domain-candidate records. Requires researched limitation fields for open source-gap and roster-requirement records. Requires independent construct-context research and limitations for affirmations and related consciousness concepts.",
